    "description": "Top-Floor Edwardian Gem with Views in North Beach/Russian Hill! Perched on the top floor of a charming 6-unit Edwardian building, this light-filled 1-bedroom, 1-bath condominium blends timeless character with modern updates. The home has been thoughtfully remodeled while retaining its classic wood floors and period charm. From the sunny living spaces, enjoy outlooks of Coit Tower and peek-a-boo Bay views - an unmistakable San Francisco backdrop. The remodeled eat-in kitchen is bright and inviting, perfect for casual dining or morning coffee. A large private storage room, in-unit laundry, shared patio, and the intimate building setting add to the home's appeal. Located near the heart of North Beach and Russian Hill, you'll have easy access to the Financial District, parks, restaurants, and transportation. With Edwardian charm, modern comfort, and postcard-worthy views, this home offers a sweet spot in one of San Francisco's most beloved neighborhoods."
  },
